#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:5
#: 172c121aeddd46f389fce696d9678b8a
msgid "Auxiliary Functions"
msgstr "辅助功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:6
#: 4745eccea3be4cc28b4a2c38ac6c92bf
msgid ""
"This page describes how to set up additional features which can be invoked "
"from the transmitter's auxiliary function switches, from Mission Planner "
"using the ``Aux function`` sub-tab of the ``Data`` tab, via MAVLink/Mission "
"command (:ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_AUX_FUNCTION <mav_cmd_do_aux_function>`) or from "
"external :ref:`buttons <common-buttons>`."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何通过遥控器的辅助功能开关、通过 Mission Planner 的 ``Data`` 选项卡下 ``Aux function`` 子页、通过"
" MAVLink/任务命令（:ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_AUX_FUNCTION <mav_cmd_do_aux_function>`）或通过外部"
" :ref:`按钮 <common-buttons>` 来触发的附加功能的配置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:9
#: 30679c67357b4f278631ac7219184e3b
msgid "Configuring which transmitter channel is used"
msgstr "配置所用的遥控器通道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:11
#: 36f3738d69ff489a80ce32bfa04dd818
msgid ""
"Any RC input channel can be assigned any auxiliary function. However, the RC"
" channel should not be used by any other function, such as flight mode "
"selection or flight controls. By default, channels 1-4 are used for flight "
"controls (i.e. roll, pitch, throttle, and yaw). The default flight mode "
"channel is 8 for Plane and Rover, and 5 for Copter."
msgstr ""
"任何 RC 输入通道均可分配辅助功能。但所用通道不应与飞行模式选择或飞行控制等其他功能重复使用。默认情况下，通道 1-4 "
"用于飞行控制（即横滚、俯仰、油门和偏航）。默认飞行模式通道在 Plane 和 Rover 中为通道 8，在 Copter 中为通道 5。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:14
#: f6997a53bbd84033a8248d1a2e534800
msgid "Assigning the Feature"
msgstr "分配功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:16
#: df6e8cf656124bf3ad38689352fcb440
msgid ""
"The ``RCx_OPTION`` parameters control these features. For example, the "
":ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` parameter controls which feature is assigned "
"to RC input 7. Each RC channel has its own ``RCx_OPTION`` parameter that can"
" be accessed in the full parameter list."
msgstr ""
"``RCx_OPTION`` 参数用于控制这些功能。例如，:ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` 参数控制分配给 RC 输入通道 "
"7 的功能。每个 RC 通道均有各自的 ``RCx_OPTION`` 参数，可在完整参数列表中访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:21
#: d1169d15007046e78be9e9687447ff4d
msgid "Supported Features"
msgstr "支持的功能"

