#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:352
#: a46d10b80942488bb15911336fdc0de3
msgid "Mode Switches"
msgstr "模式切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:354
#: 64ea231302b848e398e3b8a3ba07a7ff
msgid ""
"Any feature ending with \"mode\" provides the ability to switch the vehicle "
"into that mode by setting the RC channel to high. You can have multiple "
"\"mode\" option switches and more than one can be high at a time. The last "
"\"mode\" change switch will determine the current mode, as well as any "
"change of the normal mode switch."
msgstr ""
"任何以「mode」结尾的功能均可通过将 RC "
"通道置高来将飞机切换到对应模式。可同时设置多个「mode」选项开关，且多个开关可同时处于高位。最后一次「mode」切换开关动作将决定当前模式，同时正常的飞行模式开关变化也有效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:356
#: 876cd9468bbd49e5b0920ed5726f92fe
msgid ""
"For example, if you have a \"LOITER mode\" switch active and then an \"AUTO "
"mode\" switch is switched high, the mode will change to AUTO. Changing the "
"normal flight mode switch will again change the mode to the new flight mode "
"setting, even though both RCx_OPTION mode switches are high. Lowering an "
"active RCx_OPTION mode switch back to low will return the flight mode to "
"whatever is set on the flight mode channel, but only if the current mode "
"matches the mode set by that switch. Otherwise, it will have no effect."
msgstr ""
"例如，若「Loiter 模式」开关已激活，然后「Auto 模式」开关拨至高位，模式将切换为 "
"Auto。此时拨动正常飞行模式开关会再次切换到新的飞行模式设置，即使两个 RCx_OPTION 模式开关都处于高位。将已激活的 RCx_OPTION "
"模式开关拨回低位，将使飞行模式恢复为飞行模式通道所设定的模式，但前提是当前模式与该开关所设模式一致；否则将无效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:358
#: 0546933ca97f44dd9dce96b32d720af8
msgid ""
"Copter and Rover mode changes are not guaranteed. They may be denied if the "
"conditions required for that mode are not met. For example, changing to "
"LOITER mode in Copter would fail if the GPS lock is not active, whereas in "
"Plane the demanded mode will change and operate as best as it can."
msgstr ""
"Copter 和 Rover 的模式切换不保证成功，若不满足该模式所需的条件则可能被拒绝。例如，在 Copter 中切换到 Loiter 模式时，若 "
"GPS 未锁定则会失败；而在 Plane 中，所请求的模式将直接切换并尽力运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:360
#: e0ec6468da02418ca65b5c2dc79a5df9
msgid ""
"If mapped to a three-position switch then the SUPERSIMPLE mode function will"
" allow **SUPERSIMPLE** and **SIMPLE** modes to be enabled using the high and"
" middle switch positions, respectively (a two-position switch will "
"enable/disable SUPERSIMPLE mode only). :ref:`See here for more "
"details<simpleandsuper-simple-modes>`."
msgstr ""
"若映射到三档开关，SUPERSIMPLE 模式功能将允许在开关高位和中位分别启用 **SUPERSIMPLE** 和 **SIMPLE** "
"模式（两档开关只能启用/禁用 SUPERSIMPLE 模式）。:ref:`详情请参见此处<simpleandsuper-simple-modes>`。"

