#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:636
#: 64e7b6ac43474464b22f618e61a00db1
msgid ""
"The configured feature will be triggered when the auxiliary switch's PWM "
"value becomes higher than 1800.  It will be deactivated when the value falls"
" below 1200."
msgstr "当辅助开关的 PWM 值超过 1800 时，配置的功能将被触发；当值低于 1200 时，功能将被关闭。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-auxiliary-functions.rst:638
#: 7815d175c96b41baa85bc83719fd5de9
msgid ""
"You can check the PWM value sent from the transmitter when the switch is "
"high and low using the Mission Planner's Initial Setup >> Mandatory Hardware"
" >> Radio Calibration screen.  If it does not climb higher than 1800 or "
"lower than 1200, it is best to adjust the servo endpoints in the "
"transmitter."
msgstr ""
"您可以在 Mission Planner 的「初始设置 >> 必要硬件 >> 遥控器校准」界面检查开关处于高位和低位时遥控器发送的 PWM "
"值。若未能超过 1800 或低于 1200，建议在遥控器中调整舵机端点。"
